Centa Returns backend (Flask)

Setup
  cp .env.example .env        # then fill in the values
  pip install -r requirements.txt
  flask db upgrade
  python app.py

The first admin user is created on first start only if SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD
(and optionally SEED_ADMIN_EMAIL) is set in the environment.

Tests
  The tests need an empty, disposable PostgreSQL database. Every table in it
  is dropped and recreated on each run.

  pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
  TEST_DATABASE_URI=postgresql+psycopg2://USER:PASSWORD@localhost:5432/centa_test python -m pytest
